  cookingInstructions:
  - Chop the garlic into minced
  - Chop the onion into minced
  - Chop the siling labuyo into sliced
  - Chop the squid into sliced
  - Turn the stove to high heat
  - Put the pan in the stove
  - Add 1/8 cup of cooking oil
  - Add minced garlic
  - Add minced onion
  - Add bay leaf
  - Add slice chilies
  - Saute it using the spatula
  - 'Add Squid '
  - Add water
  - Add 1/4 cup of vinegar
  - Mix it using the spatula
  - Add squid ink
  - Put the pan Lid to simmer
  - Add the noodle in the pan
  - Turn the stove to medium heat
  - Put the pan lid to simmer
  - Add 1/8 tsp of salt
  - Add 1/8 tsp of pepper
  - Saute it using spatula
  - Add chop celery for toppings
